usage: consolidate_v5.py [-h] [--selftest]

Merge accepted t47/t49/t51 findings and delivered t50 L1/L2 data into schema
v5 without choosing between conflicting t9 framings.

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --selftest  validate all sources and preservation rules without writing

=== t52-fix1 builder help ===
usage: consolidate_v5.py [-h] [--selftest | --build]

Merge accepted t47/t49/t51 findings and E91-accepted t50 L2 data into schema
v5 without choosing between conflicting t9 framings.

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --selftest  validate all sources and preservation rules without writing
  --build     write the v5 schema pair and t52 reports

